<section id="S8" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">VIII </span><span id="S8.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Appendix</span></h2>

<section id="S8.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection"><span id="S8.SS1.6" class="ltx_text">VIII-A</span> </span><span id="S8.SS1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Hyperparameters</span></h3>

<div id="S8.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S8.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For all experiments, we use an open-source implementation of the Dreamerv3 Recurrent State Space Model (RSSM) <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib28" title="" class="ltx_ref">28</a>]</cite>. Hyperparameters for the Thermal Unicycle are included in Table <a href="#S8.T6" title="TABLE VI ‣ VIII-A Hyperparameters ‣ VIII Appendix ‣ What You Don’t Know Can Hurt You: How Well do Latent Safety Filters Understand Partially Observable Safety Constraints?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">VI</span></a> and hardware experiments in Table <a href="#S8.T7" title="TABLE VII ‣ VIII-A Hyperparameters ‣ VIII Appendix ‣ What You Don’t Know Can Hurt You: How Well do Latent Safety Filters Understand Partially Observable Safety Constraints?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">VII</span></a></p>
</div>
